<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>유호성 | 웹 기술 실습 결과물</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard/dist/web/static/pretendard.css');
        
        body { font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif; margin: 0; background-color: #020617; color: #f1f5f9; overflow: hidden; }
        
        .glass { 
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); 
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px); 
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); 
        }

        /* 버튼 카드 애니메이션 */
        .action-card {
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
        }
        .action-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-12px) scale(1.02);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
        }

        /* 비디오 모달 스타일 */
        #videoModal { display: none; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease; }
        #videoModal.active { display: flex; opacity: 1; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6">

    <!-- 좌측 상단 뒤로가기 (링크 비움) -->
    <div class="fixed top-8 left-8 z-50">
        <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 glass rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-all group">
            <i data-lucide="arrow-left" class="w-5 h-5 text-rose-500"></i>
            <span class="text-sm font-black group-hover:text-rose-400">포트폴리오 메인</span>
        </a>
    </div>

    <!-- 메인 콘텐츠 영역 -->
    <div class="max-w-6xl w-full flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <div class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 mb-6 rounded-full border border-cyan-500/30 bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase">Assignment 03</div>
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black mb-4 tracking-tighter">웹 기술 실습 결과물</h1>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-lg font-medium">데이터 분석을 활용한 세 가지 방식의 미디어 결과물입니다.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 버튼 섹션 (모든 링크 비움) -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 w-full">
            <!-- 1. 영상보기 (팝업 기능만 유지) -->
            <button onclick="openVideoModal()" class="action-card group flex flex-col items-center p-12 glass rounded-[50px] border-rose-500/20 shadow-2xl">
                <div class="w-24 h-24 bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-500 rounded-[35px] flex items-center justify-center mb-8 shadow-inner">
                    <i data-lucide="play" size="48" fill="currentColor"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-3xl font-black mb-2 transition-colors group-hover:text-rose-400">영상보기</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium">인구 분석 영상 리포트</p>
            </button>
            
            <!-- 2. 슬라이드보기 (링크 비움) -->
            <a href="#" class="action-card group flex flex-col items-center p-12 glass rounded-[50px] border-amber-500/20 shadow-2xl">
                <div class="w-24 h-24 bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-500 rounded-[35px] flex items-center justify-center mb-8 shadow-inner">
                    <i data-lucide="presentation" size="48"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-3xl font-black mb-2 transition-colors group-hover:text-amber-400">슬라이드보기</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium">전략 분석 발표 자료</p>
            </a>

            <!-- 3. 인포그래픽보기 (링크 비움) -->
            <a href="#" class="action-card group flex flex-col items-center p-12 glass rounded-[50px] border-cyan-500/20 shadow-2xl">
                <div class="w-24 h-24 bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 rounded-[35px] flex items-center justify-center mb-8 shadow-inner">
                    <i data-lucide="bar-chart-3" size="48"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-3xl font-black mb-2 transition-colors group-hover:text-cyan-400">인포그래픽보기</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium">인구 구조 데이터 시각화</p>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 비디오 모달 -->
    <div id="videoModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-[100] items-center justify-center bg-black/95 backdrop-blur-xl p-4">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-5xl bg-black rounded-[40px] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-white/10">
            <button onclick="closeVideoModal()" class="absolute top-8 right-8 z-10 bg-white/10 p-3 rounded-full text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-all">
                <i data-lucide="x" size="32"></i>
            </button>
            <div class="aspect-video w-full flex items-center justify-center">
                <!-- 비디오 소스 경로 비움 -->
                <video id="pnuminVideo" controls class="w-full h-full">
                    <source src="#" type="video/mp4">
                    브라우저가 비디오를 지원하지 않습니다.
                </video>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="fixed bottom-8 text-slate-600 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">
        Yu Ho-seong · Assignment 03 · 2026
    </footer>

    <script>
        lucide.createIcons();

        const vModal = document.getElementById('videoModal');
        const vTag = document.getElementById('pnuminVideo');

        function openVideoModal() {
            vModal.classList.add('active');
            vTag.play();
            document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
        }

        function closeVideoModal() {
            vModal.classList.remove('active');
            vTag.pause();
            document.body.style.overflow = '';
        }

        // 배경 클릭 시 닫기
        vModal.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
            if (e.target === vModal) closeVideoModal();
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
